00:15:09.276 --> 00:15:11.985
So, back to the problem,

00:15:11.986 --> 00:15:13.150
so this is the algorithm,

00:15:13.151 --> 00:15:14.925
it's actually fairly simple.

00:15:14.926 --> 00:15:16.910
So once you actually computed

00:15:16.911 --> 00:15:19.845
all the distances comparing
all these descriptors,

00:15:19.846 --> 00:15:23.200
the idea isn't to only focus
