going to help me decide.

00:16:24.781 --> 00:16:27.730
So, if these value

00:16:27.731 --> 00:16:29.330
which is some probability

00:16:29.331 --> 00:16:31.020
is actually above
this threshold,

00:16:31.021 --> 00:16:32.500
then I can actually predict that

00:16:32.501 --> 00:16:33.970
is a false correspondents

00:16:33.971 --> 00:16:35.195
because it's agreeing with

00:16:35.196 --> 00:16:37.370
the model of
the minimum distance.

00:16:37.371 --> 00:16:39.760
If not, then, likely,

00:16:39.761 --> 00:16:41.225
I can predict that
it's a good one.

00:16:41.226 --> 00:16:42.485
I'm kind of curious.
Can you go back.

00:16:42.486 --> 00:16:43.770
&gt;&gt; Yes.

