00:17:09.931 --> 00:17:12.560
&gt;&gt; Yes. Theoretically speaking,

00:17:12.561 --> 00:17:13.820
you can proving
the limit that actually

00:17:13.821 --> 00:17:15.000
will converge in
something like this.

00:17:15.001 --> 00:17:16.040
What you're talking about is the

00:17:16.041 --> 00:17:17.975
location of this distribution.

00:17:17.976 --> 00:17:20.990
Yes. The sample will affect

00:17:20.991 --> 00:17:24.025
