00:17:24.026 --> 00:17:25.600
For sure. But in the limit it

00:17:25.601 --> 00:17:27.295
actually uses the parameter
from that [inaudible]

00:17:27.296 --> 00:17:31.825
&gt;&gt; [inaudible].

00:17:31.826 --> 00:17:34.850
&gt;&gt; To this one?

00:17:34.851 --> 00:17:36.110
&gt;&gt; This is running per query?

00:17:36.111 --> 00:17:39.355
&gt;&gt; Yes, per query.
That's exactly right.

00:17:39.356 --> 00:17:41.430
Here it's fine because

00:17:41.431 --> 00:17:43.380
typically when you
